<title>JAPAN: Canon Copyer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Canon Copyer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.27		vs	   28.91</p>
<p> Operating	  617    million    vs	  362    million</p>
<p> Current		1.01		vs	  760    million</p>
<p> Net		  447    million    vs	  344    million</p>
<p> EPS		   21.05 yen	  vs	   16.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  21 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Canon Copyer Sales Co Ltd is a sales company for Canon Sales Co Ltd.</p>
